      <h2 class="section-title" id="booking-heading">Book <span>Puja, Darshan & Pravas Stay</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Experience complete spiritual peace with authorized Teerth Purohits, authentic Vedic vidhi, sanitized dharamshala accommodations, and personalized guide services.
      </p>
